{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Correction to the inventory comment above: tests/unit/test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py:78 runs `git fsck --full` through a git helper, not rebar, so it is not a CLI invocation and stays as written. That leaves scripts/probe_rebar.py and 21 test files."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792425692011409001,"uuid":"542311ee-f8ae-4e39-aaa1-509d96fe7364"}